@TiendaUCN_HostAddress = http://localhost:5094

### 1. REGISTRO (Éxito)
POST {{TiendaUCN_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Juan Perez",
  "email": "juan.perez@example.com",
  "rut": "12345678-5",
  "phoneNumber": "+569 12345678",
  "birthDate": "1990-01-01T00:00:00",
  "gender": "Masculino",
  "password": "Password1!",
  "confirmPassword": "Password1!"
}

### 2. REGISTRO (Error - Menor de edad)
POST {{TiendaUCN_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Niño Prueba",
  "email": "nino@example.com",
  "rut": "23456789-0",
  "phoneNumber": "+569 87654321",
  "birthDate": "2015-01-01T00:00:00",
  "gender": "Masculino",
  "password": "Password1!",
  "confirmPassword": "Password1!"
}

### 3. LOGIN
# @name login
POST {{TiendaUCN_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "juan.perez@example.com",
  "password": "Password1!"
}

### Guardar Token del Login
@authToken = {{login.response.body.token}}

### 4. LISTAR PRODUCTOS (Cliente)
GET {{TiendaUCN_HostAddress}}/api/product?PageNumber=1&PageSize=10

### 5. AGREGAR AL CARRITO
POST {{TiendaUCN_HostAddress}}/api/cart/add?userId=1&productId=1&quantity=1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 6. VER CARRITO
GET {{TiendaUCN_HostAddress}}/api/cart/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 7. CHECKOUT
POST {{TiendaUCN_HostAddress}}/api/cart/checkout/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 8. HISTORIAL DE ÓRDENES
GET {{TiendaUCN_HostAddress}}/api/order/history
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 9. LOGOUT
POST {{TiendaUCN_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
